        "description": "Validate whether an idea needs a ChatGPT app, a widget, or a simpler website or tool flow.",
        "target_user": "Product manager"
      },
      {
        "title": "Implement MCP Widget Flows",
        "description": "Use mcp-use examples to connect server tools, React widgets, widget props, and LLM-visible output.",
